  triage:description "criteria_from_object tests fields.is_none_or(..) and then calls fields.expect(\"checked above\"). The expect is safe only because of the earlier branch (unwrap-safe by convention), and the same pattern recurs at line 200 (criteria.get(id).expect(..)). Recommendation: Use let Some(fields) = fields.filter(|f| f.len() >= 2) with a single let-else early return, so no expect is needed." ;
